title: "Reproducibility package: the ten-year evolution of gut microbiota research in cancer therapy resistance"
abstract: "Code and derived data accompanying a bibliometric study of gut microbiota in cancer therapy resistance, including the deduplication pipeline, the BERTopic topic model, the D3TEM dynamic-evolution analysis, the quality and topical-relevance assessment, and the sensitivity analyses."
